{
  "Npcs.SandMother.Desc": "The Sand Mother is a towering woman of imposing stature and bust. She wears a much silkier, regal-looking robe than her sisters, and it barely serves to contain her four milk-laden breasts, straining under their jiggling weight. Dangling around her in a way that reminds you oddly of a halo, the Sand Mother's blonde-white hair fans around her, hanging long behind her. The queen witch is brandishing a pearly white scepter rather threateningly, though from the way she holds it, it's clear she doesn't intend to use it as a physical weapon."
  "Npcs.SandMother.Name": "Sand Mother"
}
